            },
            {
              "rating": 3,
              "description": "```Effectively solves complex technical problems independently```"
            },
            {
              "rating": 4,
              "description": "```Demonstrates innovative problem-solving abilities; helps others overcome technical challenges```"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
